<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87535" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθῡμ-έομαι</span></b> , impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προὐθυμούμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.12
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				402b
			</span></i>; in <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεθ-</span></b>  (with 
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθ-</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				5.78
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				9.38
			</span></i>, also in <i><span class="en">
				X.
			</span></i><i>Ages..</i><i><span class="en">
				2.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				395d
			</span></i>: fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθυμήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					2.3.3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Men.</u>
				74b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Plt.</u>
				262a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθυμηθήσομαι</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				25.17
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				115c
			</span></i>: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προὐθυμήθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					1.6
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.1.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				69d
			</span></i>: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτεθύμημαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Bull.Soc.Alex.</u>
					7.67
				</span></i>
			:—<i>to be ready, willing, eager to do</i> a
			thing, c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.36
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				206
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1173
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				3.9
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃς ἂν προθυμεῖσθαι
				ἐθέλῃ δίκαιος γενέσθαι</span> will <i>show zeal</i> in
			becoming . . , <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				613a
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Phd.</u>
				75b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>La.</u>
				186a
			</span></i>, etc.; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὅκως . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.91
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				91a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.ὅθως ἂν εὐδαιμονοίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ly.</u>
					207e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ὑστερήσειε . . , προεθυμεῖτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ages.</u>
					2.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs. (though
			an inf. may commonly be supplied), <i>show zeal, exert
				oneself,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				383
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				630
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				6.4.22
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>to be of good cheer, in good spirits,</i> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθυμέω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				6.2.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. acc.
			objecti, <i>to be eager</i> or <i>zealous for, desire ardently,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ξύμβασιν, τὴν ὁμολογίαν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.90
			</span></i>: mostly with neut. Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῦτο, ὅπως . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
				</span></i>
			 l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδὲν ἄλλο ἢ τοῦτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					64a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				472e
			</span></i>, al., v. l. in <i><span class="en">
				460d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. περί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					581a22
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
